<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>随笔杂谈 on 111qqz's blog</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/categories/%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%94%E6%9D%82%E8%B0%88/</link><description>Recent content in 随笔杂谈 on 111qqz's blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><copyright>© 2015-2026 111qqz</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 21:39:17 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://111qqz.com/en/categories/%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%94%E6%9D%82%E8%B0%88/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>写在毕业八年之后</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2026-08-08-%E6%AF%95%E4%B8%9A%E5%85%AB%E5%B9%B4%E5%90%8E/</link><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 21:39:17 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2026-08-08-%E6%AF%95%E4%B8%9A%E5%85%AB%E5%B9%B4%E5%90%8E/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;好久没在博客上写东西了。确实是因为比较忙，但还是要写一写、做一些输出，不然人的表达能力是会退化的。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2022 TO DO list</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2022-02-26-2022-to-do-list/</link><pubDate>Sat, 26 Feb 2022 18:12:20 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2022-02-26-2022-to-do-list/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;竟然一下子就2022年了，时间过得真快。 还是简单列一下TODO list吧。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>使用github actions来部署 github pages</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2021-01-23-using-github-actions-to-deploy-github-pages/</link><pubDate>Sat, 23 Jan 2021 17:08:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2021-01-23-using-github-actions-to-deploy-github-pages/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;目前我的博客是部署在github pages上，源码是一个repo,渲染出来的静态页面是一个repo. 更新的时候是把后者作为前者的submodule.
感觉这种方式有些落后了，简直和某司内部的平台有的一比。因此尝试采用了下github actions，来自动化这个部署的流程。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2020年终总结</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2021-01-03-my-2020/</link><pubDate>Sun, 03 Jan 2021 16:54:57 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2021-01-03-my-2020/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;本来不知道写什么所以不打算写了，不过后来觉得可以把今年做的一些重大的决定写出来，把当时的分析和想法记录下来。这样若干年后再回看，就能找到，是哪些明智或愚蠢的决定，对人生产生了巨大的影响。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>thinkpad t430 manjaro系统安装nvidia驱动</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2020-04-11-install-nvidia-driver-on-thinkpad-t430-manjaro-system/</link><pubDate>Sun, 12 Apr 2020 07:10:14 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2020-04-11-install-nvidia-driver-on-thinkpad-t430-manjaro-system/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;前几天装驱动把笔记本搞崩溃了..重新装了kde桌面环境的manjaro&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2020 to do List</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2020-02-21-2020-to-do-list/</link><pubDate>Fri, 21 Feb 2020 20:12:51 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2020-02-21-2020-to-do-list/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;就..终于再次出现了to do list. 原因是之前一直不知道如何置顶文章&amp;hellip;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>写在毕业一年之后</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2019-06-28-one-year-after-graduation/</link><pubDate>Sat, 29 Jun 2019 01:04:09 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2019-06-28-one-year-after-graduation/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;转眼毕业一整年了，是时候做一个复盘了。
依稀记得刚入职的时候leader提醒我要有职业规划时的场景。总体来说，这一年虽然没有完全走在最正确的路线上，但是大方向应该没有太偏。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>迁移博客到hugo</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2019-06-01-hello-hugo/</link><pubDate>Sat, 01 Jun 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2019-06-01-hello-hugo/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;发现工作之后更新博客的频率低了很多，以及迫于不想在自己维护服务器了，因此决定把博客迁移到hugo上。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>BattleBlock Theater linux下无法启动的解决办法　（　void* MemoryBlock::Alloc(unsigned int): Assertion failed ）</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2019-05-01-battleblock-theater-linux/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 May 2019 12:09:18 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2019-05-01-battleblock-theater-linux/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在steam上买了　BattleBlock Theater，　官方说支持linux，但是却无法启动。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>manjaro /archlinux 下 steam 文明5/6(civilization V/VI)的运行方法</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2019-02-23-manjaro-archlinux-civilization/</link><pubDate>Sat, 23 Feb 2019 14:28:01 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2019-02-23-manjaro-archlinux-civilization/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;系统版本为Manjaro 18.0.3 Illyria&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;运行文明5比较容易，只需要设置启动选项为:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2019 to do list</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2019-01-01-2019-to-do-list/</link><pubDate>Tue, 01 Jan 2019 13:13:04 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2019-01-01-2019-to-do-list/</guid><description>&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt; * &amp;lt;del&amp;gt;Operating Systems: Three Easy Pieces&amp;lt;/del&amp;gt;
 * fluent python
 * &amp;lt;del&amp;gt;《计算机网络:自顶向下方法》&amp;lt;/del&amp;gt;
