&lt;p&gt;明天约了鹅厂面试。。。然而从四月就开始一直考试考试考试&amp;hellip;.感觉药丸啊？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>为什么。。。为什么会变成这样呢。。。</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-04-27-why-is-it-like-this/</link><pubDate>Thu, 27 Apr 2017 07:53:22 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-04-27-why-is-it-like-this/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;连着考试。。。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;取消考试周这做法就是蠢。。。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;白天上课晚上考试。。。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;说得好像没有考试周大家就不会复习了一样。。。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>20140419</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-04-19-20140419/</link><pubDate>Wed, 19 Apr 2017 12:56:13 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-04-19-20140419/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;最让你恶心痛苦的那些人，你必要从他们身上学到最重要和有用的东西。
所有的痛苦都不能白受，克我者必生我。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>..........呜呜呜</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-03-31-e5919ce5919ce5919c/</link><pubDate>Fri, 31 Mar 2017 07:45:10 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-03-31-e5919ce5919ce5919c/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&amp;hellip;.拿到offer结果被人同情得问&amp;hellip;&amp;ldquo;你怎么这么惨&amp;rdquo;&amp;hellip;还不止被一个人这样说&amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>预言向：大概还是要再打一年的</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-03-11-e9a284e8a880e59091efbc9ae5a4a7e6a682e8bf98e698afe8a681e5868de68993e4b880e5b9b4e79a84/</link><pubDate>Sat, 11 Mar 2017 19:36:57 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-03-11-e9a284e8a880e59091efbc9ae5a4a7e6a682e8bf98e698afe8a681e5868de68993e4b880e5b9b4e79a84/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;虽然说感觉这届学弟蛮厉害&amp;hellip;不知道能不能拿到校内资格。。。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>再见2016</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-01-27-e5868de8a7812016/</link><pubDate>Fri, 27 Jan 2017 13:22:24 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-01-27-e5868de8a7812016/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;所以还是稍微写写年终总结吧..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;感觉&amp;hellip;2016分成了两部分吧，前11个月是一部分，后1个月是另一部分。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>又是这种绝望的感觉...</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-01-07-e58f88e698afe8bf99e7a78de7bb9de69c9be79a84e6849fe8a789/</link><pubDate>Sat, 07 Jan 2017 13:02:56 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-01-07-e58f88e698afe8bf99e7a78de7bb9de69c9be79a84e6849fe8a789/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;绝望什么的&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;总要有个具体的事情吧&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;可是又说不清&amp;hellip;好像突然每件事都让我绝望&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>大概功课不忙才有资本谈恋爱吧2333</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-01-07-e5a4a7e6a682e58a9fe8afbee4b88de5bf99e6898de69c89e8b584e69cace8b088e6818be788b1e590a72333/</link><pubDate>Sat, 07 Jan 2017 06:18:04 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-01-07-e5a4a7e6a682e58a9fe8afbee4b88de5bf99e6898de69c89e8b584e69cace8b088e6818be788b1e590a72333/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;“元旦打算干嘛？”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“复习啊，你微机接口复习好了？数据库复习好了？体系架构复习好了？编译原理复习好了？嵌入式复习好了？”&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>其实每个时代都有不同的诱惑</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-01-06-e585b6e5ae9ee6af8fe4b8aae697b6e4bba3e983bde69c89e4b88de5908ce79a84e8afb1e68391/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Jan 2017 10:45:55 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-01-06-e585b6e5ae9ee6af8fe4b8aae697b6e4bba3e983bde69c89e4b88de5908ce79a84e8afb1e68391/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;人生大概就是同各种欲望，各种诱惑做斗争的过程吧。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>